WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.748 --> 00:00:07.853
Every date that matters in one place: classes, openings, deadlines, Study Week, and the end of term.

2
00:00:07.853 --> 00:00:15.455
Scan the term at a glance. Deadlines cluster at two points in the term. Seeing them early is the whole game.

3
00:00:15.455 --> 00:00:26.032
Download the calendar file. The download button gives you a file your phone or computer calendar can subscribe to, so the dates live where you already look.

4
00:00:26.032 --> 00:00:34.189
Treat Blackboard as the official source. If anything ever differs, Blackboard and your professor's announcements win.

5
00:00:34.189 --> 00:00:36.819
Nothing here is graded.

6
00:00:36.819 --> 00:00:43.370
Where next: Put the two deadline clusters into your own planner now, before they are close.
